# Excluded from the *-built branches. `.github` is deliberately kept: release
# tags point at the built branch, and GitHub resolves a release-triggered
# workflow from the tag's tree, so stripping it stops the WordPress.org deploy
# from ever firing. `.distignore` keeps it out of the WordPress.org release.
